WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.347
What is a collage?.

2
00:00:01.507 --> 00:00:04.479
A collage is a picture made by sticking pieces down.

3
00:00:04.639 --> 00:00:07.193
Paper, fabric, foil and wool can all go in.

4
00:00:07.353 --> 00:00:11.765
Instead of painting a colour, you can find a piece that is already the right colour.

5
00:00:12.465 --> 00:00:13.672
Tear or cut.

6
00:00:13.832 --> 00:00:17.222
Tearing makes a soft, furry edge, good for clouds and hills.

7
00:00:17.382 --> 00:00:21.051
Cutting makes a sharp, clean edge, good for roofs and stars.

8
00:00:21.211 --> 00:00:23.673
Look at the edge of the real thing, and choose.

9
00:00:24.373 --> 00:00:25.487
Add to show it.

10
00:00:25.647 --> 00:00:28.805
If a picture does not show what you mean, add something.

11
00:00:28.965 --> 00:00:31.194
Crumpled paper makes a trunk look rough.

12
00:00:31.354 --> 00:00:33.444
Shiny foil makes stars twinkle.

13
00:00:33.604 --> 00:00:35.833
See-through tissue makes water look deep.

14
00:00:36.533 --> 00:00:37.601
Paper cuts.

15
00:00:37.761 --> 00:00:43.938
In China, people have cut pictures from paper for more than a thousand years, often from red paper.

16
00:00:44.098 --> 00:00:46.420
They fold the paper first, then cut.

17
00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:48.902
When they open it, both halves are the same.
